  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "nR9g61vR3Mcz"
   },
   "source": [
    "Consider the following examples (from [Financial Times](https://www.ft.com/content/38be4231-21cf-46e3-8b6a-88a4e923f01c), [Reuters](https://www.reuters.com/business/finance/prosecutors-visit-dws-offices-again-over-alleged-greenwashing-2024-02-01/) and [DWS Homepage](https://www.dws.com/en-ch/solutions/sustainability/)):"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "id": "vHqsI37T3PlU"
   },
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "### Statements about DWS ESG practices\n",
    "\n",
    "example_sources = \"\"\"\n",
    "SOURCE REUTERS:\n",
    "U.S. regulators said in September that DWS was due to pay $25 million to settle\n",
    "charges over misstatements regarding its environmental, social, and governance (ESG)\n",
    "investing and failures in policies designed to prevent money laundering.\n",
    "\n",
    "------\n",
    "\n",
    "SOURCE Financial Times:\n",
    "DWS made misleading statements in its 2020 annual report over the size of its ESG assets.\n",
    "A executive claimed she was fired after informally raising her concerns internally and\n",
    "subsequently filed a formal whistleblower complaint.\n",
    "\n",
    "------\n",
    "SOURCE DWS:\n",
    "DWS has long recognized the importance of ESG factors for investors and was among the early\n",
    "signatories of the United Nations-backed Principles for Responsible Investment (PRI) in 2008.\n",
    "\"\"\""
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "y_p09FSS5o9J"
   },
   "source": [
    "In this exercise, we want to learn about the power of prompt engineering. Prompting engineering can be seen as a iterative process of refining the instruction to a model. We want to iteratively distill judgements on DWS' ESG practices through the given sources. We start by creating a summary. Thereby, we want to follow general prompt engineering guidelines."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "fw5pspty7g3P"
   },
   "source": [
    "***1. Write clear and specific instructions***\n",
    "\n",
    "The effort you put in equals to the results you get out."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {
    "id": "Lzf0Nmxe7kz7"
   },
   "source": [
    "***2. Structure the text: Use Delimiters***\n",
    "\n",
    "For the model to understand content correctly, it is extremely helpful to use delimiters to separate texts from each other (see for instance \"-----\" above)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": null,
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/",
     "height": 135
    },
    "id": "UBBtsd1h6yCb",
    "outputId": "6a5f6d2a-0bd4-4135-f67f-54de3f1b87c2"
   },
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "text/html": [
       "\n",
       "            <h3>Output:</h3>\n",
       "            <p>DWS has been a signatory of the United Nations-backed Principles for Responsible Investment since 2008, indicating a long-standing recognition of the importance of ESG factors for investors. However, recent regulatory actions and whistleblower complaints suggest that there have been misstatements and failures in policies related to ESG investing and money laundering prevention. This indicates a potential gap between the company's stated commitment to ESG and its actual practices.</p>\n",
       "            "
      ],
      "text/plain": [
